For the Σ⁺ meson, the rest energy is 1385 MeV and the lifetime is \(2.0 \times 10^{-23} \, \text{s}\). The width \(\Gamma\) is:

\[
\Gamma = \frac{1.054 \times 10^{-34} \, \text{J s}}{2 \times 2.0 \times 10^{-23} \, \text{s}} = 5.3 \times 10^{-12} \, \text{J}
\]

